OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle, the
OL,7,Frain occasionally heavy in the west.
OL,8,FSome drier and brighter spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping through the Lothians and
OL,10,Feastern Borders.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will remain mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain, occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy. Some drier spells expected
OL,15,Fthrough the Lothians and eastern
OL,16,FBorders. Moderate southwest winds and
OL,17,Fvery mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
