OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, the rain heavy at times. Drier
OL,7,Fand brighter spells developing through
OL,8,Fthe evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,11,FBright spells and showers, some of the
OL,12,Fshowers heavy. A more organised band
OL,13,Fof heavy and perhaps thundery rain
OL,14,Fcould cross from the west on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
